# Preview APK build folder sync

APK builds use `C:\a3billiards` (short path). That folder is a **mirror** of this repo — not the live workspace.

## After every new feature (or batch of related changes)

1. Finish the feature in the workspace (`C:\Users\ibrah\Desktop\A3 Main\a3-billiards-os`).
2. **Sync to the build folder** before considering the work done for mobile testing:
   ```powershell
   pnpm sync:build-folder
   ```
3. If `packages/` dependencies changed, also run in the build folder:
   ```powershell
   cd C:\a3billiards; pnpm install
   ```

## Only build APKs when all planned features are in

Do **not** build preview APKs mid-sprint unless the user asks. When ready:

```powershell
pnpm build:preview-apks
```

`build:preview-apks` syncs once at the start, then builds owner, customer, and admin. Individual builds via `build-preview-apk.ps1` also sync unless `-SkipSync` is passed.

## Deploy Convex when backend changes

If `packages/convex/` changed, deploy to the dev deployment used by preview APKs (`ardent-albatross-880`):

```powershell
cd packages/convex; npx convex dev --once
```
